Redux builds on [url=https://github.com/LaughingLeader/BG3ModManager][b]LaughingLeader's BG3 Mod Manager[/b][/url] and retains substantial upstream code and behavior. It also uses [b]Norbyte's LSLib[/b] and other open-source libraries, fonts, accessibility components, and icons.

